
### 1. Test API
GET http://localhost:5000/api/test


### 2. Get All Members
GET http://localhost:5000/api/members


### 3. Create a New Member
POST http://localhost:5000/api/members
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Rahul Patil",
  "age": 25,
  "gender": "Male",
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "email": "rahul.patil@example.com",
  "membershipPlan": "Monthly",
  "membershipStartDate": "2026-10-14",
  "status": "Active"
}


### 4. Get One Member
# Replace MEMBER_ID with the actual MongoDB _id
GET http://localhost:5000/api/members/6acf835be011cef0e5475d39


### 5. Update a Member
# Replace MEMBER_ID with the actual MongoDB _id
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/members/6acf835be011cef0e5475d39
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 26,
  "membershipPlan": "Quarterly"
}


### 6. Delete a Member
# Replace MEMBER_ID with the actual MongoDB _id
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/members/6acf835be011cef0e5475d39
